            <changeDesc xml:id="c8q267r2">
               <p xml:id="pg6vidy2">Fol. 15r, system 2, fourth semibrevis, and system 3, fourth semibrevis should rather be dotted semibreves. Extended them, wrapped in choice.</p>
            </changeDesc>
         </change>
         <change xml:id="ce4a1vy1" isodate="2024-12-22" n="3" resp="#projectstaff-17">
            <changeDesc xml:id="ccd7uct1">
               <p xml:id="pd0r4ke1">Fol. 15r, system 4, the ryhthm sign on the first single note is missing. Added the sign for a semibrevis.</p>
            </changeDesc>
         </change>
         <change xml:id="c4t9c3r2" isodate="2025-08-18" n="4" resp="#projectstaff-17">
            <changeDesc xml:id="cq65fhu1">
               <p xml:id="plo6tqq2">Replaced the fermatas in the middle of the piece with the corresponding rhythm signs. Added annot in case that the fermata does not stand for a brevis.</p>
